{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026oraN3kP7pF1794995410.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>領展放售旗下5個停車場及長沙灣零售物業，估值高達5億元。</p><p></p><p>領展委託仲量聯行及高力香港，代理出售一籃子收租物業組合，包括黃大仙鵬程苑、葵涌葵康苑及黃大仙下邨(一)停車場，天水圍天宏苑、紅磡邨商舖及停車場，及長沙灣寶熙苑商場。</p><p></p><p>組合位處成熟民生社區，總樓面約逾30,000平方呎。5個停車場提供約373個車位，整個組合在今年3月時，估價約5.1億元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:44:10.260299+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T10:37:17.255419+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:37:17.255419+00:00","content_hash":"f4a20c143c494b4ac1ca3e1369dbf40aee82b75f81658bdc76eefcd645d6844d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}